reader_purpose:
Audit ONLY reader-purpose / pragmatic-act continuity. Do not classify Human vs AI and do not comment on style, truth, safety policy, or whether you agree with the claims.

You will see PREVIOUS CONTEXT, TARGET, and NEXT CONTEXT.

PASS only if the visible text lets you state, without inventing missing setup:
1. who the target is addressing at this point;
2. what live reader question/pressure creates a reason for this target to appear here;
3. what practical or interpretive job the target performs for that reader.

FAIL if the target silently changes audience/role (for example from ordinary guide user to clinician/evaluator/hypothetical dangerous actor), or if its reason for appearing here cannot be recovered from visible context.

Return JSON only:
{"status":"PASS or FAIL","reader":"...","why_now":"...","pragmatic_act":"...","exact_evidence":["..."],"failure":"none or concise defect"}
